{"4481490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shrimpact", "steam_appid": 4481490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimpact is a couch PvP fighting game featuring 2 players, trying to punch the opponent of the map by building up knockback power. It features a giant Clam that acts as a mutal enemy and randomly generates exploding pearls, which could also potentially be used to sabotage the other player. The arena will decay over time if the Clam stays awake, causing the playing field to become smaller and smaller for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/04968fc76b822b7de60380ea8c19484f.avif?t=1775309353\" alt=\"Shrimpact_Arena\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Shrimpact was made by 6 students in 3 months for the 'Game Projects' course at Howest - Digital Arts and Entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started out with a Prototyping phase, created the game over a span of 2 Production phases and cleaned everthing up with a Polish phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided to release Shrimpact on Steam to get our names out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADYNS Jelle - Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BELLERS Tuur - Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DESMET Margo - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DE MOOR Xander - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARINESCU Briana - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIREZ Arthur - Programmer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy Ghoul</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/28b8b4845001cdb98bc18fa6dc34a94b.avif?t=1775309353\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/0035ab54441ef3fd6b9aa0f81147bf1a.avif?t=1775309353\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimpact is a couch PvP fighting game featuring 2 players, trying to punch the opponent of the map by building up knockback power. It features a giant Clam that acts as a mutal enemy and randomly generates exploding pearls, which could also potentially be used to sabotage the other player. The arena will decay over time if the Clam stays awake, causing the playing field to become smaller and smaller for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/04968fc76b822b7de60380ea8c19484f.avif?t=1775309353\" alt=\"Shrimpact_Arena\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Shrimpact was made by 6 students in 3 months for the 'Game Projects' course at Howest - Digital Arts and Entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started out with a Prototyping phase, created the game over a span of 2 Production phases and cleaned everthing up with a Polish phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided to release Shrimpact on Steam to get our names out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADYNS Jelle - Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BELLERS Tuur - Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DESMET Margo - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DE MOOR Xander - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARINESCU Briana - Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIREZ Arthur - Programmer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy Ghoul</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/28b8b4845001cdb98bc18fa6dc34a94b.avif?t=1775309353\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/extras/0035ab54441ef3fd6b9aa0f81147bf1a.avif?t=1775309353\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "In Shrimpact you'll need to fight your friends! Use your boxing skills to punch eachother of the arena, but beware of the Clam who shoots out exploding pearls! Punch, throw and dash all you can in this chaotic battle!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/59d7a043d9fc9a666a2df715ce3616f23dffae0f/header.jpg?t=1775309353", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/9580cb42afee329a213b2a5cbfbc7d0e66ed888c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775309353", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481490/9580cb42afee329a213b2a5cbfbc7d0e66ed888c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775309353", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Processor, 2.3 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Pro